        "label": "Shape model",
        "description": "A prolate ellipsoid fitted to Voyager measurements and Hubble photometry. Its long axis is twice the short axis; the equal short axes are a source assumption. Gray grid marks unavailable registered surface imagery. Shared lighting reveals the approximate shape.",
